  "description": "meme-id: the_fucking_dishwasher_is_acting_up; hasOverallIntent: Abusive; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a person frustratedly interacting with a dishwasher, with the text overlay \"the fucking dishwasher is acting up!\". The use of the expletive \"fucking\" indicates strong frustration or anger directed at the appliance. This is an abusive meme because it uses vulgar language to express irritation toward an inanimate object, which can be seen as a form of verbal abuse. The meme's intent is to humorously exaggerate the common experience of appliance malfunction, but the language itself is abusive and potentially offensive to those sensitive to profanity. There is no targeting of any specific group or community, so it does not fall under cyberbullying, harmful, hateful, misogynous, or propaganda categories. The intent is to convey frustration through exaggerated language, using the juxtaposition of the image (a person struggling with a dishwasher) and the text (a profanity-laden complaint) to create a relatable and humorous moment of domestic annoyance.",
